  "details": "As far as i understand at the moment the program is completely deserialized for each UdonBehaviour, including bytecode or metadata.\nBut in most cases this is not necessary since the bytecode and metadata do not change during execution, but only the Heap changes.\nIt seems to me that there is an opportunity to remove some repetitive deserialization operations or somehow clone a heap for each new instance of the program.",
